  <wpt lat="55.60113430292459" lon="13.000841143426088"><name>Morescobron</name><desc>Pälsar och damkappor var största inkomstkällan för AB Moresco som lät bygga upp sitt fabrikshus precis intill vid Torggatan.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="55.601602358239" lon="12.995329112885"><name>Fersens bro</name><desc>bro i Malmö</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="55.59006528253193" lon="13.005418961066745"><name>Omnibusstationen</name><desc>In 1887, horse-drawn trams were introduced to Malmö, operated by a private company.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="55.58835420775585" lon="13.007422171827695"><name>Södervärns station</name><desc>Södervärn station was built in 1886, on the Malmö-Ystad line that opened in 1874.</desc></wpt>
  <wpt lat="55.58706292229833" lon="13.011218366120811"><name>Järnvägsövergången</name><desc>From 1874, when the railway between Malmö and Ystad was opened, trains ran along what is now Lönngatan, and effectively divided the area into North and South Sofielund.</desc></wpt>
